                            <comment id="16237532" author="oignatenko" created="Fri, 3 Nov 2017 12:19:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I managed to reproduce this issue in branch &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/tree/ignite-2.3&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;ignite-2.3&lt;/a&gt;. Note that amount of nodes at step 2 seems to be critically important to catch it: in my attempts starting an example without nodes or with only one node passed without issues while reported exception happened only when 2 and 3 nodes were started.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
